# 🗺️ Master Implementation Plan — SevaSahayog Volunteer Experience & Feedback Platform

## 🎯 Executive Overview
The **SevaSahayog Foundation Volunteer Experience Platform** digitizes feedback collection, activity design, and corporate stakeholder reporting for ~35 monthly volunteering events.

It solves the operational challenge of unstructured, verbal, and fragmented human feedback by providing:
1. **Quick Volunteer Experience**: 1-minute guided feedback collection post-activity.
2. **Asynchronous Text & Theme Classification**: Rule-based & multilingual text analytics extracting sentiment, themes, and urgent concerns without blocking API threads.
3. **Multi-Tenant Scoped Reporting**: Role-based access control (RBAC) ensuring corporate SPOCs view only their own company outcomes, while Admins view cross-organization benchmarks.
4. **Export & Real-time Alerting**: Instant CSV report downloads and automated email notifications for urgent concerns (rating $\le 2$ or safety/emergency keywords).

