## 📊 Database Schemas & Indexes (`backend/src/models/`)

### `Feedback` Schema (`feedback.model.js`)
```javascript
{
  activityId: { type: ObjectId, ref: 'Activity', required: true },
  volunteerId: { type: ObjectId, ref: 'User', required: true },
  corporatePartnerId: { type: ObjectId, ref: 'CorporatePartner', required: true },
  overallRating: { type: Number, min: 1, max: 5, required: true },
  organizationRating: { type: Number, min: 1, max: 5 },
  impactRating: { type: Number, min: 1, max: 5 },
  comments: String,
  suggestions: String,
  language: { type: String, default: 'en' },
  themes: [{
    themeId: { type: ObjectId, ref: 'FeedbackTheme' },
    themeName: String,
    sentiment: { type: String, enum: ['positive', 'neutral', 'negative'] },
    confidenceScore: Number
  }],
  isUrgent: { type: Boolean, default: false },
  submittedAt: { type: Date, default: Date.now }
}
// Indexes
{ activityId: 1, volunteerId: 1 } (Unique)
{ corporatePartnerId: 1, submittedAt: 1 }
{ isUrgent: 1 }
```

