## 🧪 Verification & Testing Strategy

### 1. Automated Test Suite (`npm test`)
Executes `backend/src/test_all.js` verifying:
- English & Hindi classifier theme extraction.
- Fail-safe notification wrapper execution.
- Urgent concern alert dispatch.

### 2. Manual HTTP API Verification
- `POST /activities/:id/feedback`: Validates 201 Created, 403 Forbidden, 409 Conflict.
- `GET /feedback`: Validates Admin filtering and SPOC corporate scoping.
- `GET /feedback/export`: Validates CSV attachment streaming.

